OL,5,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,6,     FIn 2011, Julie Dixon murdered her
OL,7,     Ffiance David Twigg by locking him
OL,8,     Fin a cupboard and starting a fire,
OL,9,     Fbut told the police that it was
OL,10,     Fpart of a suicide pact.
OL,11,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,12,     FIn 1990 the body of Cardiff girl
OL,13,     FGeraldine is discovered in a ditch
OL,14,     Fclose to her family home a few
OL,15,     Fdays before Christmas. With no DNA
OL,16,     Fmatches found, the case goes cold
OL,17,     Ffor ten years...
