OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FIt's another busy day for the
OL,7,     Fcasualty team with patient numbers
OL,8,     Funusually high. Sister Rachel is
OL,9,     Frunning the shift, and she's under
OL,10,     Fpressure with a shortage of
OL,11,     Fcubicles.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Dev removes the clinic's
OL,14,     Fheaviest lipoma yet. Dr Natalia
OL,15,     Finvestigates an unsual rash, while
OL,16,     FDr Adil, Dr Emma, and Dr Magnus
OL,17,     Fface cysts and a
OL,18,     Fcareer-threatening lump.
